DESCRIPTION:Topic	:	DBS Career Jam (CN)	\nSynopsis	:	Do you have questions 
	on internal mobility? Join us as we hear from employees who have done inte
	rnal mobility\, hiring managers and releasing managers to debunk some of t
	he myths you may have!	\nSpeaker	:	Various employees from BUSUs	\n\n______
	__________________________________________________________________________
	______________________________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a la
	ptop or mobile device through the application:\n1. Click on this hyperlink
	: Webex Meeting Link  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m6876035d9fc0f
	3f71c93a50b9f55dcc3> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit he
	re  <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-too
	ls.aspx?market=Singapore&category=Communication> to find out more about We
	bex \n\nMeeting password: 6gcYwpQ7PQ2 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If y
	ou are joining via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1.
	 Press the "Call" icon\n2. Dial 25113758980@dbs.webex.com into the search 
	bar and press "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-tim
	e Host KEY. Click here to see how to retrieve your Host KEY  <https://dbs1
	bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewp
	ath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20D
	ocuments%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a73
	1%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20D
	ocuments%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a lapto
	p through the Web browser: \nFor external parties who do not wish to downl
	oad the application \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link  <htt
	ps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m6876035d9fc0f3f71c93a50b9f55dcc3> \n2. 
	Click on ‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click
	 on ‘Join from your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address an
	d join the meeting \n\nClick here  <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/n
	rbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meeting> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are 
	dialling in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges
	 may apply.\nNote if you are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to
	 start the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\
	,%23> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nInd
	ia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia
	\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiw
	an +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Numb
	er: 2511 375 8980#\nGlobal call-in numbers  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/glo
	balcallin.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team!
	  <mailto:webexsupport@dbs.com> \n\n
